      "title": "Warm Coffee, Cold Morning",
      "punchline": "\"Seven years vanished in seven seconds.\"",
      "caption": "Seven years vanished in seven seconds.\n\nDAY 28 OF 30 • ACT IV: THE UNDENIABLE US – MUNICH & HOME WAS YOU - Warm Coffee, Cold Morning\n\nNeither remembered how they escaped the festival's drunken roar, only the frantic taxi ride back to his apartment, clinging together like shipwreck survivors. Morning arrived with crisp autumn light through floor-to-ceiling windows. Isha sat swaddled in his oversized fleece pullover, cradling a steaming mug of black coffee, watching him lean against the kitchen counter.\n\n\"Seven years vanished in seven seconds,\" she murmured, steam curling between them. \"Seven years of surviving without living,\" Sid replied softly, handing her an extra scarf. Outside, fallen maple leaves carpeted their walk toward BMW Welt, fingers intertwined, bridging a lifetime of silence.\n\nThis is Day 28 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Ilahi (Acoustic Morning Walk) Â· Pritam\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nCrisp autumn walks with hot coffee: who would you want walking beside you? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #lovestory #nalkudilstudio",
