      "title": "Only Yours",
      "punchline": "\"I’m still your glowing queen. Only yours.\"",
      "caption": "I’m still your glowing queen. Only yours.\n\nDAY 29 OF 30 • ACT IV: THE UNDENIABLE US – MUNICH & HOME WAS YOU - Only Yours\n\nHer phone lit the glass table: a text from her mother with a suitor’s family photo. Sid’s chest hitched, cold panic surging. \"Is this why you vanished? Arranged, approved, German-settled?\" \"Stop it, Sid!\" Isha snapped, tears spiking her lashes. \"You think seven years erased you from my bones?\" \"Then what do you want?\" \"I don’t want safe!\n\nhe shouted, raw and desperate. \"Tell me to walk away!\" Isha grabbed his lapels, pulling him violently close, their breaths crashing. I’m still your glowing queen, you idiot. Only yours.\" His mouth crashed onto hers, silencing every doubt in wild, breathless hunger.\n\nThis is Day 29 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Maru Varthai Pesadhe (Unplugged) Â· Sid Sriram\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nHave you ever had that one confession that was 7 years in the making? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #lovestory #nalkudilstudio",
