      "punchline": "\"You were never just a place. Home was always you.\"",
      "caption": "You were never just a place. Home was always you.\n\nDAY 30 OF 30 • ACT IV: THE UNDENIABLE US – MUNICH & HOME WAS YOU - Home Was You\n\nThe temple bells replaced the Bavarian brass, ringing clear against the morning air. Draped in rich crimson silk, Isha looked down at her wrist. Beside gold bangles rested a simple red thread. Across the sacred fire sat Sid, wearing an ivory veshti, his eyes steady, unblinking, and entirely hers. \"Wherever we end up, home follows.\"\n\nAs he tied the thali, seven separated years dissolved into a single eternal breath. \"Told you,\" Sid whispered, sliding his thumb gently over hers amidst showering yellow rice. Isha smiled, tears glistening with triumph. \"You were never just a place, Sid. Home was always you.\"\n\nThis is Day 30 of SIDISHA - Home Was You\nA 30-Day Drabble Collection by Nalkudil Studio\nOne memory. One spark. Every morning 10:15 AM IST.\n\n🔊 Sound on: Mangalyam Thanthunanena (Nadaswaram & Thavil Traditional) Â· Wedding Symphony\n\nRead with illustrations on blog - link in bio\nFree 30-Day Booklet: iamsaravofficial.com/book-club\n\nHome isn't four walls and a roof. Who is the person that made you realize: 'Home was always you'? 👇\n\n#sidisha #homewasyou #drabble #lovestory #nalkudilstudio",
